check 1
# A belt potion drunk mid-fight from one shared input script: a level-3
# Barbarian with a short sword and minor healing potions in belt column 0
# (slots 0 and 4) warped to the Blood Moor (level 2) before frame 4; a
# fallen party (monstats 19, normal) spawned next to the player before
# frame 30 with the seeds fixed (as combat-melee-fallen); before frame 60
# the player's life (stat 6) is set to 10 points so the drink shows
# whatever the fallens hit; before frame 70 `key 1` (belt column 0,
# command 23: C->S 0x26 [item GUID][0][0]; ui/controls.md §3.2, §7 r3).
# Compare the player's hp frame by frame and the belt item's removal
# (state), and the C->S ids (packets).
# Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name combat-potion-midfight
save CmbPot --class bar --expansion --level 3 --item ssd/body=4 --item hp1/belt=0 --item hp1/belt=4
seed 1234
ticks 150
seconds 300
channels state packets
at 4 poke warp 2
at 30 poke seed-game 0x00001234 666
at 30 poke seed-unit @player 0x00000055 666
at 30 poke spawn 19 @x+3 @y normal
at 60 poke stat @player 6 0 2560
input frame 70; key 1
